      "discover": {
        "kind": "text",
        "title": "Moda blogu: Bir haftam",
        "body": "Hi, I'm Defne and I'm a teacher. People often ask me: \"What do you wear to work?\"\n\nFrom Monday to Thursday I usually wear trousers, a shirt and comfortable shoes. I stand all day!\n\nOn Fridays our school is casual, so I wear jeans, a T-shirt and trainers.\n\nAt the weekend I love wearing dresses. In winter I always wear my big red coat and a hat.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "type": "multipleChoice",
            "prompt": "What does Defne wear on Fridays?",
            "options": [
              "Trousers and a shirt",
              "Jeans, a T-shirt and trainers",
              "A dress"
            ],
            "answerIndex": 1,
            "explanation": "\"On Fridays ... I wear jeans, a T-shirt and trainers.\"",
            "id": "a1-u10-l1-d01"
          },
          {
            "type": "multipleChoice",
            "prompt": "Why does she wear comfortable shoes?",
            "options": [
              "She walks to school.",
              "She stands all day.",
              "They're cheap."
            ],
            "answerIndex": 1,
            "explanation": "\"I stand all day!\"",
            "id": "a1-u10-l1-d02"
          }
        ]
      },
      "learn": {
        "explanation": "**wear** = giymek / üzerinde olmak. Kıyafet, ayakkabı, şapka, gözlük, saat için de kullanılır.\n\n- I **wear** jeans at the weekend.\n- She **wears** glasses.\n\n**Hep çoğul olan kıyafetler:** trousers, jeans, shorts, shoes, trainers, glasses. Bunlarla **are** ve **these/those** kullanılır:\n\n- My jeans **are** blue. (~~My jeans is~~)\n- **These** trousers are nice.\n\nTek bir tane için: **a pair of** trousers / shoes (bir pantolon, bir çift ayakkabı).",
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "I always wear a jacket in autumn.",
            "tr": "Sonbaharda hep ceket giyerim."
          },
          {
            "en": "Your shoes are dirty!",
            "tr": "Ayakkabıların kirli!"
          },
          {
            "en": "I want to buy a pair of jeans.",
            "tr": "Bir kot pantolon almak istiyorum."
          }
        ],
        "turkishNote": "Türkçede \"pantolon\" tekildir (bu pantolon), İngilizcede trousers çoğuldur (these trousers are). \"Şapka takmak\", \"gözlük takmak\" İngilizcede de wear: wear a hat, wear glasses."
      },
